<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer matches played on Sunday:</p>
<p>NAC Breda 2 (Vidmar 13, Stewart 36) Ajax Amsterdam 0. Halftime</p>
<p>2-0. Attendance 16,204.</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 1 (Konterman 74) PSV Eindhoven 0. Halftime</p>
<p>0-0. Attendance 10,500.</p>
<p>Sparta Rotterdam 0 Groningen 2 (Gorre 45, Magno 76). Halftime</p>
<p>0-1. Attendance 3,000.</p>
<p>NEC Nijmegen 0 Vitesse Arnhem 1 (Machlas 59). Halftime 0-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 6,000.</p>
